---
description: Explain learning outcomes using only observed interaction and authorized score scope.
args:{scenario:ArenaScenario;turns:ArenaTurn[];review:{valid:boolean;questions:string[];authorityFailures:string[];feasibility:FeasibilityArtifact|null;}}
returns:{feedback:string[];learningEvidence:string[];privateFeedback:string[];releasedScores:string[];}
---
Compare observable questions, terms, offers, clarifications and final agreement with the exercise learning goals. Separate good process from lucky outcome and identify a missed trade only when exact model evidence supports it. Never infer personality or reward prohibited tactics. Keep private preferences and score bands out of learner feedback unless the explicit debrief policy authorizes release.
